<!--Post: 12028--><!--Time: 1111513285-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12028"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megabyte<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megabyte<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 9:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t know how you guys feel about this, but I&#39;m happy that the creep is behind bars it is just crazy, I personnaly don&#39;t think he wanted to be caught I think he made a mistake and everything went downhill from there for Dennis Rader.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12028-->
<!--Post: 12059--><!--Time: 1111542291-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12059"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 5:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree, Megabyte - I feel much better now that he is arrested.  The thing that I feel most is relief that this person is not free to do these things any more.  I know that, statistically, it doesn&#39;t make us any safer &#40;or just to a tiny degree&#41;, but I just feel safer knowing that he has been caught. <BR> <BR>I also have increased confidence in law enforcement - particularly their ability to use the slightest bit of physical evidence and go with it.  For all the criticism that people have had - right or wrong - they came through when they got a fragmentary lead. <BR> <BR>I think you&#39;re right also - he didn&#39;t want to get caught.  He was just addicted to his media fix, and found that he needed more and more.  It shouldn&#39;t surprise us - his addiction to the realization of fetish fantasies was not much different from his media fix, both being only a stone&#39;s throw biochemically from crack cocaine.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12059-->
<!--Post: 12065--><!--Time: 1111543984-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12065"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 6:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That&#39;s ironic you guys mention that, cause I see people in a different light now. Almost, like I&#39;m not scared of the boogie man anymore or the big bad wolf. After living in fear of this most of my life and then finding out DTDC lived down the street, I almost feel invincible when I look at someone that could be threatening to others. I taken on the attitude, &#34;well hell how bad could this scary lookin guy be when a serial killer lived down the street from me&#34;. Is that wierd or what?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12065-->
<!--Post: 12084--><!--Time: 1111556274-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12084"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 9:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That makes sense, Rocky.  You&#39;re experiencing what we are, but on total steroids.  Living almost at &#34;BTK ground zero&#34;, you folks must have experienced fear 10 times as bad as those further away from his nest.  When the focus moved up North, and people were talking like he might make a comeback tour, you folks must have been in some real fear.  What you&#39;re describing sounds like when you&#39;ve just got off a roller coaster - and you feel ready for anything.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12084-->
<!--Post: 12138--><!--Time: 1111642478-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12138"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Glad<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Glad<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 23, 2005 - 9:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky, I am so happy for you and others there in Witchita area that you can finally put to rest the anguish of not knowing who he is or where he is.  My hearts go out to all of you and his victims as well as his family and loved ones.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12138-->
<!--Post: 12194--><!--Time: 1111733493-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12194"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megabyte<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megabyte<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 10:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The DA suppossedly took the DNA out of Rader&#39;s Daughter&#39;s medical file without a court order that is unconstitutional, and that could blow the case, could somebody confirm if this is true, my source is <a href="http://www.ksn.com" target=_top>http://www.ksn.com</a> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12194-->
<!--Post: 12208--><!--Time: 1111765332-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12208"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Mega - saw the Same article - but I haven&#39;t seen anything else on it...I am going to call my family in Wichita this weekend and see if they can confirm OR if there is any more news on this matter.  ROCKY - your family resides there also...have you or them heard anything? <BR>Thanks! Else<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12208-->
<!--Post: 12242--><!--Time: 1111795674-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12242"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 4:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Subpoena!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12242-->
<!--Post: 12270--><!--Time: 1111816318-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12270"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 9:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I saw something that stated that they had a warrant but did not have a protective order issued. I hope that does not negate all the evidence they collected and the arrest. If the article about the girl at KFC is true, I think that he was working up to another kill. At least she was on guard. He just got sloppy in his old age.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12270-->
<!--Post: 12271--><!--Time: 1111817486-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12271"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 10:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What&#39;s the worst that can come out of improper proceedure in obtaining his daughter&#39;s DNA? Have the evidence of her DNA match denied as trail evidence? It doesn&#39;t really matter. They have her father&#39;s DNA and it&#39;s a match to BTK. <BR>Did her DNA lead them to take his DNA? If they had no other reason to ask for his DNA you might argue that it could jepordize the case but the computer disc led them to him as a suspect giving them enough reason to get his DNA. The Home Depot security tapes have him making a communication drop. Evidence secured from the home that links him to BTK through a proper search warrant was obtained as well.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12271-->
<!--Post: 12349--><!--Time: 1112040902-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12349"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 28, 2005 - 12:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Glad, Thank you! I want you all to know that although I don&#39;t live in Wichita any longer I do print these posts&#39; out and give them to my Dad. My Dad has no desire to ever own a computer. I still want him and the neighbors to know that there are people all over the world that care.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12349-->
<!--Post: 12351--><!--Time: 1112042536-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12351"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 28, 2005 - 12:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky...how nice of you to do that for your dad.  He does need to know that we all care about him and the other innocent residents past and present of Park City....<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12351-->
<!--Post: 12446--><!--Time: 1112235944-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12446"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megabyte<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megabyte<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 30, 2005 - 6:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->here is a link to my own discussion board that I set up, I&#39;m not trying to promote more traffic to my message board, because it is a sub-domain that is why I really don&#39;t care to promote traffic to it, I just want to know what you guys think about the case, no registering is required just enter a name and begin typing, link: <a href="http://b3.boards2go.com/boards/board.cgi?user=newswebmaster" target=_top>http://b3.boards2go.com/boards/board.cgi?user=news webmaster</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12446-->
<!--Post: 12447--><!--Time: 1112236043-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12447"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megabyte<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megabyte<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 30, 2005 - 6:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK case is all right, It turns out police have the right to take medical record out without consent in a investigation, such as one like this, so Denny will still be charged.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12447-->
<!--Post: 12594--><!--Time: 1112511464-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12594"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 02, 2005 - 10:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m relieved.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12594-->
<!--Post: 12815--><!--Time: 1113288779-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12815"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 11, 2005 - 11:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Still relieved.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12815-->
<!--Post: 13037--><!--Time: 1114009404-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13037"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 20, 2005 - 8:03 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I just read an article on Kansas.com....I am sooooo irritated.  The budget for DTDC&#39;s defense is at 405,000 - some of the money will be used for expert witness&#39;s. <BR>Part of me wants to hear the stuff at trial....the other big part of me says just get it overwith...the s.o.b. is loving the attention...let him plead guilty and go away...even if it means we and the residents of Wichita and especially the victims family&#39;s won&#39;t ever get the &#34;Why&#39;s&#34; answered.  Even if he does state a &#34;reason&#34; for his torture and unexcusable behavior...it won&#39;t be enough... or good enough...and should he go straight to jail he is so arrogant he will find a way to tell his sorry story... <BR>I feel so bad for Wichita...the money could be used in so many many more constructive ways - <BR>Hey - how about spliting it up amongst the victims remaining families...OR to fund programs for the LE so that they could aprehend individuals as DTDC without the stress of funding... <BR>VIctims rights.  There just doesn&#39;t seem to be any. <BR>But ol&#39; Denny...look at the money that will be spent on defending his demon a&#42;&#42;.. <BR>I know he is lovin it. <BR>That bothers me most of all. <BR>His smuggness. <BR>I am venting. <BR>Sorry.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13037-->
<!--Post: 13040--><!--Time: 1114013109-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13040"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 20, 2005 - 9:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Else - you crack me up! Yes, I did survive the blizzard and couldn&#39;t make it to the office a couple of days! Yea! Our elevation is around 6800 feet, so when it&#39;s raining in the Springs it&#39;s snowing at my house. <BR> <BR>Even the demon a&#42;&#42; has a right to a fair trial. I really didn&#39;t want to hear the details through a trial, I&#39;m getting sick thinkin about what the families are going to be subjected to. Still, I was hopeful that DTDC had grown a conscience through the ministering of his preacher and would spare the families the cruelty of a trial. I don&#39;t what I was thinkin. Demon @&#42;&#42;!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13040-->
<!--Post: 13043--><!--Time: 1114019075-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13043"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 20, 2005 - 10:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky - from what I have read and heard, most of the families are hoping for a trial..unless I misread something. There will never be any REAL answers to this psycopath - only addtional horrors. <BR>I just would like to see justice done but not at the taxpayer&#39;s expense. <BR>Hey- you must live in EG? Am I close? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13043-->
<!--Post: 13061--><!--Time: 1114047776-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13061"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 20, 2005 - 6:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Else - I&#39;m gettin something different from a smaller source. I agree, demon @&#42;&#42; is ready to tell that part of his story. The expense for this demon @&#42;&#42; to tell his story, it&#39;s what pisses me off too! <BR> <BR>Actually, I&#39;m closer to Pikes Peak!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13061-->
<!--Post: 13239--><!--Time: 1114634186-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13239"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 27, 2005 - 1:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If he pleads guilty, we probably won&#39;t find out what really happened. If he pleads not guilty, he probably won&#39;t take the stand, but at least we will have the witness testimony about the evidence.  <BR> <BR>Talk about relief. Since the arrest of the BTK suspect four police officers have gone back to their anti-gang intelligence work and gang violence is down. <BR>-Deb <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/11498930.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/11498930.htm</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13239-->
